floorplan:**ERROR: (IMPIMEX-12):	'init_design' failed. You are missing one or more of the required commands before running init_design.
floorplan:The MMMC init sequence looks like this: 
floorplan:read_mmmc top.mmmc 
floorplan:read_physical -lef {tech.lef stdcell.lef}   #optional in Tempus, required for Innovus 
floorplan:read_netlist top.v OR 'elaborate_design -script hdl.tcl' for Synthesis flow 
floorplan:read_power_intent -1801 top.1801   #only for MSV designs 
floorplan:init_design 
floorplan:
floorplan:Tempus also supports a single-mode timing init sequence with no MMMC file like this: 
floorplan:read_libs all.lib 
floorplan:read_netlist top.v 
floorplan:read_sdc top.sdc 
floorplan:init_design 
